cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
title: "Aditya-L1 ASPEX-SWIS CME Detection Pipeline"
authors:
  - name: "Arinjay"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aur1ety/Model-for-Coronal-Mass-Ejection-detection"
abstract: >-
  Autonomous Coronal Mass Ejection detection from real-time in-situ solar-wind
  plasma measurements (ISRO Aditya-L1 ASPEX-SWIS) using a TCN+TCAN ensemble.
  Only the TCN validation F1 (0.3101) has been independently reproduced; the
  May 2026 blind-test results are logged, not reproduced. Companion to Magnuson (MAG magnetometer)
  and Roentgen (SoLEXS/HEL1OS X-ray) — three instruments, one mission.
keywords:
  - coronal mass ejection
  - solar wind
  - Aditya-L1
  - machine learning
